WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.049 --> 00:00:12.543
Between rounds, open the between-round check done after Heat 1.

2
00:00:12.543 --> 00:00:16.815
The mechanic noted an issue: a small oil weep on the RR shock.

3
00:00:16.815 --> 00:00:23.236
Back in the workshop, In the Workshop shows what needs attention.

4
00:00:23.236 --> 00:00:31.576
The oil change is due, and the RR shock is close to its rebuild.

5
00:00:31.576 --> 00:00:33.622
In Car maintenance, open Schedules.

6
00:00:33.622 --> 00:00:40.974
When the oil change is done, press Done today and the count starts again.

